<title>ESTONIA: TALLINN CITY TO SELL TALLINNA PANK STAKE.</title>
<headline>TALLINN CITY TO SELL TALLINNA PANK STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn city government on Friday said it had decided to sell its seven percent stake in Tallinna Pank via a written tender.</p>
<p>&quot;The shares will be sold outside the stock exchange through a tender process and the minimum price will be the price on the stock exchange on the same day,&quot; Tallinn mayor Robert Lepikson told a press converence.</p>
</text>
